        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"contents\": [{\n    \"parts\": [{\n      \"text\": \"You are a senior engineer. Given an unknown issue, provide: 1) Root cause hypothesis 2) 4-6 investigation steps 3) Escalation path. Be concise.\\n\\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\\nDesc: {{ $json.description }}\"\n    }]\n  }]\n}"
